      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukabamo khwe kamaloba ka kaarama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we khuula sibala, Baisiraeli boosi babusiana e Shilo mala basimikhayo liiema lie kumuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chabayo chikholo saba che Baisiraeli chichaba ne chisiili khunyoola kumukabwa kwabwe kwe kamaloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Yoshua aboolela Baisiraeli ali, “Mulaliinda khukhwola liina nio mwingile ne khuaamba kamaloba niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka benywe, amuelesia? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khe mumbe babaandu be siseecha bataru khukhwama buli mu kholo. Nenya khubaruma bache khulambuula, mala bachoore epicha eye kamaloba niko mwenya kabe kakenywe, mala bangobolele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bacha khukaba kamaloba mu bitonyi saba, lisaaye lia Yuda licha khumenya mu maloba kabwe ebunafubo, ne lisaaye lia Yosefu mu maloba kabwe e bunaswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamalile khuandika kimikabwa saba kie kimikuunda kino banderere. Nio ekhupe chikura",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ekhupe chikura:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lino liekholekhanga khulwe khurumikhira kamabaale kakhasala ta khumanyilisia bunyali bwa Wele. Lola lundi 14.2.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balawi, se balanyoola kumukabwa kwe kamaloba ne nanywe tawe, sikila kumukabwa kwabwe kuli busaayi, khukholela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi kimilimo. Chikholo cha Kati, Rubeni, nende balala khu kholo eya Manase chamala khunyoola kamaloba kabwe ebukwe owa Yoritani, niko Musa, Omukholi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, aabaelesia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Babaandu barakikha lukeendo. Yoshua alaka ba bacha khu choora efwaani eye kamaloba ali, “Cha mulambuule kamaloba koosi, muchoore nga ne kali mala mungobolele. Ne ese ndareeba bunyali bwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi e Shilo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babaandu abo bacha balambuula kamaloba mala bachoora efwaani yako mu sitabu, buli lukoba mu bitonyi saba. Nio bakobolela Yoshua mu kambi e Shilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua apa chikura khu maloba ako ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala akaba Baisiraeli buli ekholo ne abuundu wayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamaloba ka kaakabwa khu Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamaloba ke lisaaye lie ekholo eya Benjamini khuloondekhana ne kimiliango kiayo niko kakanyoa khukabwa. Kamaloba kano kaba akari we chikholo cha Yuda ne Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulwakha lwabwe lwarakikhira lubeka lwe bunaswa khu Yoritani, mala lwaniina lwacha lwekha mu maayo mwe ebunaswa owa Yeriko. Lundi lwaniina mumbo mwe sibala sie bikulu lwamaliilikhila mu sichiimi sie Beta-beni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama ao lulwakha lwabirira mu maayo ebunafubo lwola Lusi (lisina liliindi bali Beteli). Nio lwekha Atoroti-atari ne khu sikulu sili ebunafubo we emwaalo owa Beti-horoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama Beti-horoni, lulwakha, lwakobola lubeka luluundi lwe mumbo siafubo we sikulu sino mala lwacha khu Kiriati-Baali (namwe Kiriati-Yearimu) luli lwe kholo eya Yuda. Luno nilwo lulwakha lwe mumbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulwakha lwe lubeka lwe siafubo lwarakikhira embi ne Kiriati-Yearimu mala lwacha Efurani lundi lwacha lwola khu numa eye kameechi ka Nefutoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio lwekha mu maayo khu lwakha lwe sikulu sili siimbi ne Litooma lio musoleeli owa Hinomu, khundulo khwe bunaswa we Litooma lia Refaimu. Nio lundi lwacha ebunafubo lwabirira mwitooma lia Hinomu, ebunafubo we lukoba lwe Bayebusi khukhwola Enirokeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio lwakobola lubeka lwe ebunaswa lwacha Enishemeshi mala lundi lwacha e Kililoti, eyaloleelela Engila echa Atumimu. Mala lulwakha lwekha emwaalo khu libaale lia Bohani (Bohani aba okhwa Rubeni) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala lwabirira ebunaswa we lubeka lulwaloleelela Litooma lia Yoritani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama eyo, lwabirira e bunaswa we lubeka lwa Beti-Hokula, mala lwamaliilikhila ebunaswa we kumukhono kwe enyanja eya chumbe, niio luluuchi lwa Yoritani luweelamo. Luno nilwo lulwakha lwe ebunafubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoritani lwaba lulwakha lwe lubeka lwe ebukwe. Kuno kwaba kumukabwa kwe kholo eya Benjamini khuloondekhana ne kimiliango kiayo buli ekholo ne lulwakha chimbeka choosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chingoba chichaba che kholo eya Benjamini chaba Yeriko, Beti-Hokula, Emeki Kesisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beti-araba, Semaraimu, Beteli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimu, Para, Ofura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kefari-amoni, Ofuni, Keba: chingoba likhumi ne chibili alala ne birekere biacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi chabayo chingoba cha Kibeoni, Rama, Beeroti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misipa, Kefira, Mosa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rekemu, Iripeeli, Tarala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
